fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"webrtc/index.html#webrtcbin::request-post-rtp-aux-sender","fragment":"\n\trequest-post-rtp-aux-sender\n\nRequest an AUX sender element for the given dtls-transport,\nthat is placed between RTPBin and Transportbin..\nParameters:\nthe webrtcbin\nThe GstWebRTCDTLSTransport object for which the aux\nsender will be used.\nA new GStreamer element\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});